    "Sıfır-bir-dört-dokuz baş salladı ve beni büyük odaya götürdü."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1184
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_b549384c:

    # "As the fleshy doors parted, the other Terrans bowed their heads in submission as I entered."
    "Etli kapılar ayrılırken, diğer Terranlar ben içeri girerken başlarını teslimiyetle eğdi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1188
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a7dc02de:

    # "There, the Hive Lord gazed out through one of the many great eyes of the blinking ship, staring into the vast sea of stars."
    "Orada, Kovan Lordu geminin yanıp sönen birçok büyük gözünden birinden dışarı baktı, uçsuz bucaksız yıldız denizine bakarak."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1189
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_1192c5f3:

    # "He tilted his head toward me as I entered, then returned his gaze to the void."
    "Ben içeri girerken başını bana doğru eğdi, sonra bakışlarını boşluğa geri döndürdü."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1190
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_9bdb9c50:

    # HIVE_LORD "...You have done well, Lord Shyahtan."
    HIVE_LORD "...İyi iş çıkardın, Lord Shyahtan."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1191
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_94da6ee9:

    # SHYAHTAN "I have done as expected of me. Nothing more, nothing less."
    SHYAHTAN "Benden beklendiği gibi yaptım. Daha fazlası değil, daha azı değil."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1192
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_2bcb60ec:

    # HIVE_LORD "Of course."
    HIVE_LORD "Elbette."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1193
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_caa012f2:

    # HIVE_LORD "You have never failed me before, have you?"
    HIVE_LORD "Beni daha önce hiç hayal kırıklığına uğratmadın, değil mi?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1194
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_493721cc:

    # "There was a long pause between us."
    "Aramızda uzun bir duraklama oldu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1195
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_e0e94156:

    # SHYAHTAN "...Hive Lord?"
    SHYAHTAN "...Kovan Lordu?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1196
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_247840f6:

    # HIVE_LORD "...I am told you are refusing the Great Joining once more this year."
    HIVE_LORD "...Söylendiğine göre bu yıl Büyük Birleşme'yi bir kez daha reddediyorsun."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1197
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_928a9605:

    # HIVE_LORD "May I ask why?"
    HIVE_LORD "Nedenini sorabilir miyim?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1198
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_caa3608d:

    # SHYAHTAN "The other Terran lords do not understand I am your hammer, great Hive Lord."
    SHYAHTAN "Diğer Terran lordları anlamıyorlar, ben sizin çekicinizim, büyük Kovan Lordu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1199
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d26154ca:

    # SHYAHTAN "They seek to prove their clans would serve best as your will."
    SHYAHTAN "Onlar klanlarının sizin iradeniz olarak en iyi hizmet edeceğini kanıtlamaya çalışıyorlar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1200
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_58800eef:

    # SHYAHTAN "The Great Joining."
    SHYAHTAN "Büyük Birleşme."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1201
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_7955ec9f:

    # SHYAHTAN "Merging all of our minds as one. This will only stoke the fires of their envy."
    SHYAHTAN "Tüm zihinlerimizi bir olarak birleştirmek. Bu sadece kıskançlıklarının ateşini körükleyecek."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1202
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d90ba355:

    # SHYAHTAN "I cannot be your weapon if they undermine my plans."
    SHYAHTAN "Planlarımı baltalarlarsa silahınız olamam."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1203
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a9a000a1:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}...Is that so?{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}...Öyle mi?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1204
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c18fa599:

    # "Once more, the Hive Lord broke his gaze from the black sea and stared toward me."
    "Bir kez daha, Kovan Lordu bakışını kara denizden kırdı ve bana baktı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1205
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_436bd99a:

    # HIVE_LORD "{b}Or could it be because you know your *true* feelings toward me would be laid bare for all to see?{/b}"
    HIVE_LORD "{b}Yoksa bana karşı *gerçek* hislerinin herkesin görmesi için çırılçıplak ortaya çıkacağını bildiğin için mi?{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1206
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d9acc812:

    # SHYAHTAN "..."
    SHYAHTAN "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1207
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_044ee0d7:

    # SHYAHTAN "...Great Hive Lord, my true feelings for you are nothing but-"
    SHYAHTAN "...Büyük Kovan Lordu, size karşı gerçek hislerim—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1208
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c2888de1:

    # "For the faintest moment I paused, the words coming out awkwardly."
    "En zayıf an için durakladım, kelimeler garip çıktı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1209
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_4c1502e6:

    # SHYAHTAN "{b}Loyalty and adoration.{/b}"
    SHYAHTAN "{b}Sadakat ve hayranlıktan başka bir şey değil.{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1210
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_7a86e66e:

    # HIVE_LORD "..."
    HIVE_LORD "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1211
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_aa95d732:

    # "The Great Hive Lord tilted his head forward once more."
    "Büyük Kovan Lordu başını bir kez daha ileri eğdi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1212
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5a555836:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}Of course, Shyahtan... my greatest general.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}Elbette, Shyahtan... en büyük generalim.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1213
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c5a16420:

    # HIVE_LORD "Never have I doubted your loyalty."
    HIVE_LORD "Sadakatinden asla şüphe etmedim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1214
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_b9e35433:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}...Though some believe you are destined to become the new Hive Lord once I return to our great father.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}...Gerçi bazıları büyük babamıza döndüğümde yeni Kovan Lordu olmanın kaderin olduğuna inanıyor.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1215
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_9cb9c1a8:

    # SHYAHTAN "Then give me these traitors' names and I will see to it my Zarpod feasts upon them."
    SHYAHTAN "O zaman bana bu hainlerin isimlerini verin ve Zarpod'umun onlarla ziyafet çekmesini sağlayayım."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1216
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_8ba529fe:

    # HIVE_LORD "...Do you remember the Hive Wars, Shyahtan?"
    HIVE_LORD "...Kovan Savaşlarını hatırlıyor musun, Shyahtan?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1217
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a3e3e6f7:

    # SHYAHTAN "Those of us who survived could never forget, Hive Lord."
    SHYAHTAN "Hayatta kalanlarımız asla unutamazdı, Kovan Lordu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1218
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6810b3ed:

    # SHYAHTAN "{i}Do {b}you{/b} remember, Hive Lord, how we fought side by side to exterminate the rogue hive?{/i}"
    SHYAHTAN "{i}{b}Siz{/b} hatırlıyor musunuz, Kovan Lordu, asi kovanı yok etmek için nasıl omuz omuza savaştığımızı?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1219
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_375ba8bb:

    # "The Hive Lord didn't answer."
    "Kovan Lordu cevap vermedi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1220
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_f2942cf3:

    # "With a heavy sigh, he turned fully to face me."
    "Ağır bir iç çekişle, tamamen bana döndü."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1221
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_ba3f361a:

    # HIVE_LORD "I have someone I wish for you to meet."
    HIVE_LORD "Tanışmanı istediğim biri var."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1222
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_eba7a4c2:

    # HIVE_LORD "A new strain I have helped develop."
    HIVE_LORD "Geliştirilmesine yardım ettiğim yeni bir suş."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1223
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c887cb4f:

    # HIVE_LORD "I hope you will adopt him under your clan's banners for now."
    HIVE_LORD "Umarım onu şimdilik klanının sancakları altında evlat edinirsin."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1224
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_52a67e0e:

    # "The Hive Lord turned to his personal guard."
    "Kovan Lordu kişisel muhafızına döndü."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1225
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_cbd3a895:

    # HIVE_LORD "Bring in Eight-Six-One."
    HIVE_LORD "Sekiz-Altı-Bir'i getirin."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1226
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d350cc90:

    # SHYAHTAN "One of your pet projects?"
    SHYAHTAN "Evcil hayvan projelerinden biri mi?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1227
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_8c343811:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}Something like that.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}Onun gibi bir şey.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1231
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6c73278f:

    # "As the fleshy spiral doors opened, a skinny, pale-white Terran approached."
    "Etli spiral kapılar açılırken, sıska, solgun beyaz bir Terran yaklaştı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1234
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_e5272129:

    # EIGHT_SIX_ONE "...G-Greetings, Lord Shyahtan."
    EIGHT_SIX_ONE "...S-Selamlar, Lord Shyahtan."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1235
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5f84324c:

    # MARKUS "WAKE UP!"
    MARKUS "UYAN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1236
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_47333513:

    # SHYAHTAN "A white strain?"
    SHYAHTAN "Beyaz bir suş mu?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1237
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_2daa1143:

    # SHYAHTAN "What is he-"
    SHYAHTAN "O ne—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1238
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6b39ce73:

    # "I felt the claws of the Hive Lord rest on my shoulder."
    "Kovan Lordu'nun pençelerinin omzuma dayandığını hissettim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1239
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6995b2a0:

    # HIVE_LORD "I will watch his performance with great interest, Lord Shyahtan."
    HIVE_LORD "Performansını büyük ilgiyle izleyeceğim, Lord Shyahtan."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1240
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5f59a957:

    # "The skinny Terran offered a nervous, curt bow."
    "Sıska Terran sinirli, kısa bir eğilme sundu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1243
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_072968fa:

    # EIGHT_SIX_ONE "I am... at your s-service, my lord."
    EIGHT_SIX_ONE "Ben... h-hizmetinizdeyim, lordum."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1258
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_16665f31:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1261
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_28f83f71:

    # MARKUS "You have to... Ahh! WAKE UP!"
    MARKUS "Yapman gerek... Ahh! UYAN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1263
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_72bdb921:

    # "My eyes peeled open as I stared out at the carnage before me."
    "Gözlerim aralandı, önümdeki katliama baktım."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1264
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_dec204cd:

    # "The arena was drenched in blood as the Caltrack flailed; bodies and torn limbs littered the ground as people screamed."
    "Arena kanla sırılsıklamdı, Caltrack savruldu; insanlar çığlık atarken bedenler ve kopmuş uzuvlar zemini doldurdu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1265
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a00a866:

    # "Even Sypha, usually smug and composed, was barking orders."
    "Genellikle ukala ve kendine hâkim olan Sypha bile emirler yağdırıyordu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1266
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6fc3a72a:

    # "Staggering, bleeding, forcing the others to keep moving and fight."
    "Sendeleyerek, kanayarak, diğerlerini hareket etmeye ve dövüşmeye zorlayarak."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1267
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_9d245642:

    # "Now, with the Caltrack's eyes fixed on her, Sypha's pupils widened; for the first time, I saw fear in her face."
    "Şimdi, Caltrack'in gözleri ona kilitlenmişken, Sypha'nın göz bebekleri büyüdü; ilk kez, yüzünde korku gördüm."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1268
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a29f88d:

    # "Any moment, it would come crashing down on her and her exhausted body wouldn't move in time..."
    "Her an, onun üzerine çakılacaktı ve tükenmiş bedeni zamanında hareket etmeyecekti..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1269
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_3226ef70:

    # "{i}...But something moved inside me now.{/i}"
    "{i}...Ama içimde şimdi bir şey hareket etti.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1270
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_b89032c8:

    # "I felt my whole body act on its own, rising as a hot surge of energy flooded through me."
    "Tüm bedenimin kendi kendine hareket ettiğini hissettim, içimden sıcak bir enerji dalgası aktı, yükseldim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1271
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_42819c2d:

    # "{i}What was going on?{/i}"
    "{i}Neler oluyordu?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1273
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_aeaf7911:

    # "Moments ago, I was dying, and now..."
    "Anlar önce, ölüyordum ve şimdi..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1274
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_c8bf02ac:

    # "I sprang forward. Faster than before."
    "İleri sıçradım. Öncekinden daha hızlı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1275
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_ad41bb57:

    # "Faster than I'd ever moved."
    "Şimdiye kadar hareket ettiğimden daha hızlı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1277
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f01b3c92:

    # "With a single motion, I swept Sypha from the sand and yanked her clear of the snapping jaws."
    "Tek bir hareketle, Sypha'yı kumdan süpürdüm ve onu kapan çenelerden uzaklaştırdım."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1278
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8fa10aa1:

    # "She stared up at me, shock and disbelief warring in her eyes."
    "Bana baktı, gözlerinde şok ve inanmazlık savaştı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1279
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_e3fb0534:

    # "I set her down gently and turned back to the Caltrack."
    "Onu nazikçe yere bıraktım ve Caltrack'e geri döndüm."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1280
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_4cfa3603:

    # "It snapped one of its many jaws toward me."
    "Birçok çenesinden birini bana doğru kaptı."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1281
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_bb5a2503:

    # "A quick pivot carried me past it."
    "Hızlı bir pivot beni onu geçirdi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1283
translate tr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f96435af:

    # "A tentacle latched on and punched through the creature's cheek as I flung myself into the air, crashing down onto one of its heads and driving my claws through its eye."
